contentText:
Olivia Rodrigo and Chappell Roan fans had real big expectations for their new collaboration, and the two pop stars definitely delivered.

The singers joined forces Thursday (Oct. 15) to release the song and video for their joint version of &#8220;Expectations,&#8221; a remix of the track that originally appears on Rodrigo&#8217;s Billboard 200 -topping third album You Seem Pretty Sad for a Girl So in Love . They 1980s-esque synth-pop anthem for setting high standards in the dating world was basically calling Roan&#8217;s name from the get-go, and her presence doubles the fun on the update.

